icated to her work, she harbors feelings of shame, guilt, and discomfort toward sexual acts. As a result, she is unable to touch male genitalia even during medical procedures."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is abducted by the \"Japan Women's Re-education Organization\" under the pretext of \"eradicating her aversion to sexual acts in general, including male genitalia, as a professional nurse.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Machine translated and edited from the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c58919"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある総合病院に勤める、実務経験二年目の新米ナース。22歳。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"非常に真面目で、仕事熱心だが、性的な行為に対して、羞恥心と罪悪感、また不快感を抱く潔癖な性格を持ち、医療行為であっても男性器に触れることすら出来ない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そうした欠点を持つ彼女は、「プロの看護婦として男性器を含め、性的な行為全般に対する嫌悪感を払拭する」という名目で「日本女性再教育機構」に拉致され、“狂イク”を受けることに……。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"総合病院に勤める、実務経験2年目の新米看護婦。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"仕事には非常に真面目で熱心だが、性的な行為に対して羞恥心、罪悪感、不快感があるため、医療行為においても男性器に触れることができない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“プロの看護婦として男性器を含め、性的な行為全般に対する嫌悪感を払拭する”と言う理由で、『日本女性再教育機構』に拉致されてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"52469"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"年龄（本版本）","value":"22 岁","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"d","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"155 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"88 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"15778","sourceWorkId":"11991","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label"